# Runtime artifacts / credentials / training IP (never publish)
# Widened 2026-08-11 on Greg's typed GO: the exact-name rule missed the
# renamed-dead variant (.EXPIRED-DISABLED-2026-08-04), which sat untracked
# and kept the parent repo's gitlink permanently dirty. Match every variant,
# same as the parent .gitignore has since 2026-08-06.
.linkedin_token*
.last_run.json
.last_image_*.png
app_output.log
extracted_images/
*.docx
*.bat
